["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">描</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>描绘；绘画；描写</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ビョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">えが.く・か.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">描く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えがく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">绘画；绘制；素描；描绘；描述；在脑海中想象；想象；形成某种形状；画出（轨迹、轮廓等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">描写</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びょうしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">描写；描述；刻画</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鈴</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>铃；铃铛；蜂鸣器</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レイ・リン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すず</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鈴</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すず</span><span class=\"k-wz\">铃；铃铛</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">盤</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>盘；浅碗；碟；板；唱片</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">基盤</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">基础；根基；基石；地基；基础设施；基岩；岩床；平台</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地盤</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地面；地壳；河床；地层；地基；基础；底座；选区；票仓；政治基础；立足点</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">算盤</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そろばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">算盘；珠算盘；计算；核算；盈亏计算</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">項</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>段落；条款；项目；项（表达式）；颈后</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うなじ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">項目</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうもく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">项目；标题；类别；条款；词条；词目；辞头</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">事項</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事项；项目；事实</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">喪</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>哀悼；丧失；送葬</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">も</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">伴</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>伴随；陪同；带来；同伴</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハン・バン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ともな.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">伴う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ともなう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">伴随</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">養</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>养育；培养；发展；滋养</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ・リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やしな.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">栄養</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えいよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">营养；营养成分</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">休養</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">休养；休息；放松；恢复；疗养</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">教養</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">教养；文化修养；教育水平；素养；修养</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">街</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>街道；城镇；大街</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガイ・カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">街</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">街道；街区；地区；区域</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">街角</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まちかど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">街角；街头</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">街道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大道；主干道（尤指江户时代存在的）；（比喻）通往（成功等）的道路；途径；（中国的）街道（街道办事处辖区）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">契</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>誓约；承诺；誓言</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ちぎ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">契約</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">合同；契约；协议</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">契機</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">机会；契机；触发因素；起因；诱因</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">契る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちぎる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">立誓；发誓；承诺；盟誓；同房；共寝；发生性关系</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">掲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>张贴；悬挂；举起；刊登；描述</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かか.げる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">掲示</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">通知；公告；张贴；公示；告示</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">掲載</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刊登；刊载；刊印；发表；刊出</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">掲げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かかげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">悬挂；张贴；挂出；升起；展示；高举；举过头顶；标榜；宣扬；树立；打出；刊登；刊印；登载；卷起；撩起；烧旺（火）；煽旺（火焰）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">躍</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>跳跃；舞蹈；蹦跳</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヤク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おど.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">活躍</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かつやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">活跃；积极活动；活跃表现；精力充沛地走动；健步如飞</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">棄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>丢弃；抛弃；放弃；舍弃；牺牲</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.てる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">棄権</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弃权；放弃权利；退赛</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">廃棄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">废弃；放弃；报废；丢弃；废除；取消；撤销；废止</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">破棄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">撕毁并丢弃；销毁；废除；取消；撤销；宣布无效；毁约；（上诉）推翻；撤销</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">邸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>宅邸；公馆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やしき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">邸宅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていたく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大宅；住宅；豪宅</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">縮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>收缩；缩短；缩小；起皱；减少</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ちぢ.む・ちぢ.まる・ちぢ.める・ちぢ.れる・ちぢ.らす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">圧縮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あっしゅく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">压缩；浓缩；缩短；概括；（数据的）压缩</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">恐縮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうしゅく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">感激不尽；感恩戴德；深感荣幸；对给人添麻烦深感抱歉；为自身过失深感惭愧；因受夸奖或盛情款待而深感不好意思；因恐惧而退缩；畏缩</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">縮小</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缩小；削减；裁减；缩减；规模缩小；萎缩；收缩</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">属</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>属于；种类；下属官员；附属</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゾク・ショク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さかん・つく・やから</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">金属</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">金属</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">附属</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">附属；隶属；所属；随附；附属学校；附设学校</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">属する</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぞくする</span><span class=\"k-wz\">属于；隶属于；从属于；受制于</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">慮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>考虑；思虑；担忧；审慎；顾虑</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おもんぱく.る・おもんぱか.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠慮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんりょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">保留；克制；谦逊；矜持；顾虑；迟疑；审慎；体贴；推辞；谢绝；克制不做；避免（做某事）；深谋远虑；预见</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">考慮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうりょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">考虑；斟酌</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">配慮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいりょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">考虑；关切；体贴；周到；安排；照顾</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">枠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>框；框架；边框；卷轴（绕线轴）；界限框</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わく</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">枠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">框架；框架结构；边框；方框；框；限制；限额；配额；类别；范围；等级；时段；播出时段；直播；网络直播；线轴；卷轴</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">恵</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>恩惠；祝福；仁慈；好意</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ・エ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">めぐ.む・めぐ.み</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">知恵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">智慧；聪慧；才智；理智；般若</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">恩恵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おんけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">恩泽；恩惠；福泽；利益</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">恵まれる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めぐまれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蒙受；得到；拥有；富于；充满</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">露</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>露水；眼泪；暴露；俄罗斯</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロ・ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つゆ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">露</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つゆ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">露水；朝露；泪水；泪珠；丝毫；一点儿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暴露</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばくろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">泄露；曝光；揭露</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">露骨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろこつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公开；不隐瞒；毫不掩饰；赤裸裸；坦率；粗俗；下流；猥亵；粗鲁</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">沖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>远海；近海；升入高空</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おき・おきつ・ちゅう.する・わく</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沖</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">外海；冲绳</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">緩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>松弛；缓和；放慢；放宽；减弱</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゆる.い・ゆる.やか・ゆる.む・ゆる.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">松的；不紧；宽松的；不严格的；平缓的；和缓的；缓慢的；微弱的；软的；不结实的；（用否定形「ゆるくない」）困难；不容易；费劲</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩和</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缓解；缓和；减轻；放宽（限制、紧张局势等）；松弛；软化</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变松弛；松弛（如绳子）；变得不紧张；放松；放松警惕；（寒冷）缓和；减弱；（监管等）变得松懈；变软（如地面、表情）；（冰）部分融化；减慢；降低（如速度）；（市场价格）小幅下跌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">節</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>节（竹节、关节）；季节；时候（场合）；章节；曲调</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セツ・セチ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふし・-ぶし・のっと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">季節</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">季节；时令</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">節</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">时间；场合；章节；段落；乐段；诗节；（语法）从句；分句；季节；时令；时期；操守；节操；（植物茎的）节；（植物分类）组（属以下的分类等级）；节（航速单位，海里／小时）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">節約</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せつやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">节约；节省</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">射</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>射箭；照射；射击；射入</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">い.る・さ.す・う.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">注射</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">注射；打针</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">射す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">照射；发光</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">発射</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はっしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">发射；射击；射出；射精</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">購</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>购买；订阅</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">購読</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">购买阅读；订阅；订购</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">購入</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうにゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">购买；购入</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">購買</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">采购；购买；购进；学校合作社；校内商店；学生小卖部</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">揮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>挥舞；摆动；指挥；发挥</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふる.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">発揮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はっき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">发挥；展现；表现；表露</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">指揮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">指挥；命令；监督；指挥（乐队、合唱团等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">充</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>填充；分配</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あ.てる・み.たす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拡充</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かくじゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">扩充；扩大；增充</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">充実</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅうじつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">充实；完整；完善；充实性；增强；改善；充实；升级；补充；充满</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">補充</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほじゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">补充；补充物；补充品；更换；补充供应</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">貢</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>进贡；支持；资助</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みつ.ぐ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貢献</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贡献；效力；进贡；纳贡</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鹿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>鹿</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しか・か</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">馬鹿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">白痴；傻瓜；愚人；愚蠢的；傻的；呆板的；荒唐的；可笑的；微不足道的；琐碎的；令人失望的；失灵的；故障的；感觉迟钝的；极其；异常；非常；狂热爱好者；迷；痴迷于某事的人；中国蛤蜊（学名 Mactra chinensis）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">馬鹿馬鹿しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばかばかしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">荒谬；可笑；愚蠢；荒唐；愚不可及</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">却</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>反而；却（表示转折）；后退；退却；退回</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かえ.って・しりぞ.く・しりぞ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">却って</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かえって</span><span class=\"k-wz\">反而；倒是；反倒；更加</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">端</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>边缘；端头；起点；尽头；边界</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はし・は・はた・-ばた・はな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">端</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">末端；尖端；边缘；边界；开始；起始；最初；零碎；残余；片段；微量</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">途端</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とたん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刚好；正好；就在……的时候；一……就；恰好在……的瞬间</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">先端</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんたん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">尖端；末梢；顶点；锋端；前沿；先锋；尖兵；领先地位</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">賃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>工资；租金；费用；运费；酬金</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">家賃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やちん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">房租；租金</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">運賃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\"