读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あわ.せる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">合併</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がっぺい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">合并；联合；兼并；整合；融合；并入；加入</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">貴</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>珍贵；贵重；尊重；尊崇；重视</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たっと.い・とうと.い・たっと.ぶ・とうと.ぶ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貴重</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">珍贵；宝贵</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貴族</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贵族；贵族阶级；贵族身份</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貴い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たっとい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">珍贵；宝贵；无价；高贵；崇高；神圣</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">埼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>海角；沙嘴；岬</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さき・さい・みさき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">衝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>冲突；撞击；刺入；冲击；天文冲（行星与太阳相对）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"