div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">災</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>灾难；灾祸；祸害；诅咒；邪恶</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わざわ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">火災</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大火；火灾</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">災難</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいなん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灾难；不幸；厄运</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">災害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灾害；灾难；不幸</span></li></ul></div></li>"]